        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514418197935-e0cac2bb695a?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NzU3MjMwNDR8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post LiteRT-LM" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;google-ai-edgelitert-lm&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;litert-lm&#34;&gt;LiteRT-LM
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;LiteRT-LM is Google&amp;rsquo;s production-ready, high-performance, open-source inference
framework for deploying Large Language Models on edge devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ai.google.dev/edge/litert-lm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Product Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-whats-new-gemma-4-support-with-litert-lm&#34;&gt;🔥 What&amp;rsquo;s New: Gemma 4 support with LiteRT-LM
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deploy &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemma-4/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Gemma 4&lt;/a&gt;
across a broad range of hardware with stellar performance
(&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://developers.googleblog.com/bring-state-of-the-art-agentic-skills-to-the-edge-with-gemma-4/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Try on Linux, macOS, Windows (WSL) or Raspberry Pi with the
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ai.google.dev/edge/litert-lm/cli&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LiteRT-LM CLI&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;litert-lm run  &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;   --from-huggingface-repo&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;   gemma-4-E2B-it.litertlm &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;   --prompt&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;What is the capital of France?&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-key-features&#34;&gt;🌟 Key Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📱 &lt;strong&gt;Cross-Platform Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Android, iOS, Web, Desktop, and IoT (e.g.
Raspberry Pi).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Hardware Acceleration&lt;/strong&gt;: Peak performance via GPU and NPU accelerators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👁️ &lt;strong&gt;Multi-Modality&lt;/strong&gt;: Support for vision and audio inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Tool Use&lt;/strong&gt;: Function calling support for agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Broad Model Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Gemma, Llama, Phi-4, Qwen, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-production-ready-for-googles-products&#34;&gt;🚀 Production-Ready for Google&amp;rsquo;s Products
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;LiteRT-LM powers on-device GenAI experiences in &lt;strong&gt;Chrome&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Chromebook Plus&lt;/strong&gt;,
&lt;strong&gt;Pixel Watch&lt;/strong&gt;, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can also try the
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/google-ai-edge/gallery&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Google AI Edge Gallery&lt;/a&gt; app to run
models immediately on your device.&lt;/p&gt;
