					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;Explore how to fine-tune FunctionGemma and enable function calling capabilities powered by LiteRT-LM Tool Use APIs.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: left&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://developers.googleblog.com/google-ai-edge-small-language-models-multimodality-rag-function-calling/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
