&lt;h2 id=&#34;-quick-start&#34;&gt;🏃 Quick Start
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;-key-links&#34;&gt;🔗 Key Links
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👉 &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ai.google.dev/edge/litert-lm/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Technical Overview&lt;/a&gt; including performance benchmarks, model support, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👉 &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ai.google.dev/edge/litert-lm/cli&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LiteRT-LM CLI Guide&lt;/a&gt; including installation, getting started, and advanced usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;-quick-try-no-code&#34;&gt;⚡ Quick Try (No Code)
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Try LiteRT-LM immediately from your terminal without writing a single line of code using &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;code&gt;uv&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;uv tool install litert-lm
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;litert-lm run &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  --from-huggingface-repo&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;google/gemma-3n-E2B-it-litert-lm &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4 &lt;span class=&#34;se&#34;&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  --prompt&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;What is the capital of France?&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;-supported-language-apis&#34;&gt;📚 Supported Language APIs
